            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">In 2023 100% of the imported Azerbaijani natural gas to RoE was imported by pipeline and 0% as LNG. An average distance of 3420 km is estimated for the pipeline export from Azerbaijan, of which are 110 km offshore pipeline. The estimated shipping distance for LNG are 0 km. The net calorific value of natural is 36.0 MJ/Nm³. UUID=a61bd6bc-89fc-35f9-a3be-f6ca1c94e696</common:generalComment>
