        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">The distance is an European average based on the European long-distance pipeline network and LNG shipping routes.\n\n# Included processes\nThis dataset describes the transport needed for an average export of Azerbaijani natural gas. Gas losses and emissions during seasonal storage are included.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
